1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,535
Hi, and welcome to Kyntlo Academy!

2
00:00:02,535 --> 00:00:04,211
I'm really glad you're here.

3
00:00:04,211 --> 00:00:07,264
In this first lesson, I'll
show you what Kyntlo is,

4
00:00:07,264 --> 00:00:11,574
walk you through everything inside
it, and explain each of our packages,

5
00:00:11,574 --> 00:00:14,508
so you know exactly which
one fits your business.

6
00:00:15,358 --> 00:00:17,231
Let's start with the problem.

7
00:00:17,231 --> 00:00:22,140
Most growing businesses juggle a pile
of separate tools: a CRM for contacts,

8
00:00:22,140 --> 00:00:26,726
another app for bookings, another
for email, another for text messages,

9
00:00:26,726 --> 00:00:29,115
a website builder, and a review tool.

10
00:00:29,115 --> 00:00:34,347
Each one has its own login and its own
bill, and none of them talk to each other.

11
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:38,479
Kyntlo brings all of that
together in one platform.

12
00:00:38,479 --> 00:00:42,916
One login, one invoice, and one
place where every lead, conversation,

13
00:00:42,916 --> 00:00:44,588
booking and payment lives.

14
00:00:44,588 --> 00:00:49,346
Because everything is connected, Kyntlo
can follow up with people for you,

15
00:00:49,346 --> 00:00:50,246
automatically.

16
00:00:51,096 --> 00:00:52,681
Here's what it looks like.

17
00:00:52,681 --> 00:00:56,949
This is a demo account for a dental
clinic called Bloom Dental Studio.

18
00:00:56,949 --> 00:01:01,400
Your dashboard shows your business at
a glance: your deals, your revenue,

19
00:01:01,400 --> 00:01:03,778
and how many leads turn into customers.

20
00:01:04,629 --> 00:01:06,932
Every tool lives in the sidebar.

21
00:01:06,932 --> 00:01:11,466
Conversations is one inbox for
email, text, WhatsApp, Facebook,

22
00:01:11,466 --> 00:01:13,410
Instagram and website chat.

23
00:01:13,410 --> 00:01:16,361
Calendars lets customers book themselves.

24
00:01:16,361 --> 00:01:21,111
And Contacts is your CRM, with the
full history of every customer.

25
00:01:21,960 --> 00:01:27,280
Opportunities shows your sales pipeline,
so you always know where every deal stands.

26
00:01:27,280 --> 00:01:31,840
Sites is where you build funnels,
websites and forms that capture leads.

27
00:01:31,840 --> 00:01:37,097
And Marketing handles your email campaigns,
text broadcasts and social media posts.

28
00:01:37,947 --> 00:01:40,734
Automation is where Kyntlo works for you,

29
00:01:40,734 --> 00:01:44,678
following up with every lead
and reminding every customer.

30
00:01:44,678 --> 00:01:49,097
AI Agents can answer chats and
even phone calls around the clock.

31
00:01:49,097 --> 00:01:53,448
And Reputation helps you collect
five-star reviews on autopilot.

32
00:01:54,297 --> 00:01:56,307
Now, let's talk about packages.

33
00:01:56,307 --> 00:02:00,521
Kyntlo comes in four plans: Starter,
Growth, Pro, and Customized.

34
00:02:00,521 --> 00:02:02,726
They all run on the same platform.

35
00:02:02,726 --> 00:02:05,708
The difference is which
tools are switched on,

36
00:02:05,708 --> 00:02:08,366
and how many people can use your account.

37
00:02:09,216 --> 00:02:10,751
Starter is $90 a month.

38
00:02:10,751 --> 00:02:16,023
It gives you the CRM, one sales pipeline,
funnels and pages, forms and surveys,

39
00:02:16,023 --> 00:02:21,295
online booking, a live chat widget for
your website, and basic email campaigns,

40
00:02:21,295 --> 00:02:22,496
for up to 3 users.

41
00:02:22,496 --> 00:02:27,301
Starter is perfect if you're getting
organised, and you want your leads,

42
00:02:27,301 --> 00:02:31,371
bookings and customers in one
place before adding automation.

43
00:02:32,222 --> 00:02:33,772
Growth is $270 a month.

44
00:02:33,772 --> 00:02:38,759
You get everything in Starter, plus 2
to 3 pipelines, workflow automation,

45
00:02:38,759 --> 00:02:44,151
automatic appointment reminders, the full
inbox with text messages and WhatsApp,

46
00:02:44,151 --> 00:02:47,049
and a basic AI chatbot,
for up to 10 users.

47
00:02:47,049 --> 00:02:50,755
Choose Growth if leads are
slipping through the cracks,

48
00:02:50,755 --> 00:02:53,923
and you want follow-up
to happen automatically.

49
00:02:54,772 --> 00:02:58,066
Pro is our most popular
plan, at $490 a month.

50
00:02:58,066 --> 00:03:02,577
It unlocks everything: unlimited
AI usage, unlimited pipelines,

51
00:03:02,577 --> 00:03:07,804
the advanced AI chatbot and Voice AI
receptionist, missed-call text-back,

52
00:03:07,804 --> 00:03:12,100
the reputation manager for
reviews, memberships and courses,

53
00:03:12,100 --> 00:03:16,181
call tracking and advanced
analytics, for up to 25 users.

54
00:03:16,181 --> 00:03:20,405
Pro is for businesses that want
AI doing the heavy lifting.

55
00:03:21,255 --> 00:03:24,895
And if your business doesn't
fit a box, there's Customized.

56
00:03:24,895 --> 00:03:29,522
You choose exactly which features you
want, with limits sized to your team.

57
00:03:29,522 --> 00:03:33,471
It can include multiple brands
or branches, custom integrations,

58
00:03:33,471 --> 00:03:37,049
campaign management by our
team, and dedicated onboarding.

59
00:03:37,049 --> 00:03:39,146
You only pay for the mix you pick.

60
00:03:39,996 --> 00:03:45,204
You can pay monthly, or choose quarterly
billing and get 50% off your first 3

61
00:03:45,204 --> 00:03:45,677
months.

62
00:03:45,677 --> 00:03:49,735
That's enough runway to set up
properly and train your team.

63
00:03:49,735 --> 00:03:53,591
After that, your plan renews
at the normal monthly price.

64
00:03:53,591 --> 00:03:58,122
Things like text messages, calls
and AI messages are pay-as-you-go,

65
00:03:58,122 --> 00:04:00,354
at wholesale cost with no markup.

66
00:04:01,204 --> 00:04:03,165
So, which plan is right for you?

67
00:04:03,165 --> 00:04:04,942
Ask yourself three questions.

68
00:04:04,942 --> 00:04:06,658
How many people will use it?

69
00:04:06,658 --> 00:04:08,926
Which channels do your customers use?

70
00:04:08,926 --> 00:04:12,358
And how much work do you want
AI to take off your plate?

71
00:04:12,358 --> 00:04:14,442
Getting organised, choose Starter.

72
00:04:14,442 --> 00:04:17,261
Losing leads to slow
follow-up, choose Growth.

73
00:04:17,261 --> 00:04:19,467
Ready for AI everywhere, choose Pro.

74
00:04:20,317 --> 00:04:24,457
Every plan starts with a 14-day
free trial, with no setup fees.

75
00:04:24,457 --> 00:04:26,232
And you're never locked in.

76
00:04:26,232 --> 00:04:29,978
You can upgrade or downgrade
any time, and your contacts,

77
00:04:29,978 --> 00:04:32,607
pipelines and automations come with you.

78
00:04:33,458 --> 00:04:38,215
This course has 15 modules, from your
first login all the way to building a

79
00:04:38,215 --> 00:04:40,244
complete lead-to-booking system.

80
00:04:40,244 --> 00:04:43,098
Each lesson is short
and focused on one task.

81
00:04:43,098 --> 00:04:48,236
Some features belong to Growth or Pro, so
look for the plan badge at the start of

82
00:04:48,236 --> 00:04:48,997
each lesson.

83
00:04:49,846 --> 00:04:51,775
Alright, that's the big picture!

84
00:04:51,775 --> 00:04:56,597
In the next lesson, we'll log in and take
a proper tour of the Kyntlo interface.

85
00:04:56,597 --> 00:04:57,440
See you there.
